fluorine-artwork (0.7.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Ship three custom wallpapers as wall1.png, wall2.png, and wall3.png under
    /usr/share/backgrounds/fluorine, so they appear in the flr-wall picker next
    to the rendered set.
  * Render each from its 1920x1080 original at 3840x2160: LANCZOS resampling
    plus a 1.0/60/2 unsharp mask on the colour channels only, so the pixel
    wordmark stays crisp without ringing and the alpha channel stays smooth.
    Every output is a lossless PNG at exactly 3840x2160.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:05:00 +0530

fluorine-artwork (0.6.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add a Zathura configuration that recolors PDF pages onto pure black with
    the light foreground, and puts the lime accent on search hits, the current
    selection, and the status bar.
  * Add a swayimg configuration with a black viewer window, fit-to-window
    scaling, and bicubic resampling for crisp images at every zoom level.

