fluorine-artwork (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Depend on fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, gsettings-desktop-schemas,
    and dconf-cli so the shipped font, schema, and dconf defaults are active.
  * Add a fontconfig alias that resolves the Space Grotesk UI family to the
    packaged Inter family, since Space Grotesk is absent from Debian 13.
  * Add the missing machine-readable copyright file under the MIT License.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:35:00 +0530

fluorine-artwork (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add unified toolkit defaults so GTK, Qt, and Electron applications match
    the AMOLED Void design language on first login.
  * Ship GTK 3 and GTK 4 settings with Adwaita dark, a 24px cursor, and
    paired gtk.css palettes using the lime accent and deep moss selection.
  * Ship a shared qt5ct and qt6ct palette plus Fusion style configuration,
    installed for every new user through /etc/skel.
  * Add a gsettings override for the prefer-dark color scheme, icon theme,
    cursor size, and window button layout.
  * Depend on qt6ct and recommend qt5ct and adwaita-icon-theme.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:05:00 +0530

